---
import SectionHead from '../SectionHead.astro';
---

<section id="problem" aria-label="Why you're losing deals you should be winning">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="col-prose">
        <SectionHead title="You're losing deals you should be <em>winning</em>." />
        <div class="prose-body">
          <p>Not because your product's worse. Not because your pitch is weak. But because when you say you're good, you're not giving them a reason to believe you.</p>
          <p><em>That's the trap.</em> Everything you say about you gets viewed through a sceptical lens. You're the seller, of course <em>you</em> think you're great. The issue isn't how you're saying it, the problem is that promises aren't enough.</p>
          <p>Promises only work if they're supported with facts. A real customer, on the record, backing up everything you promise. That's not a pitch. That's proof.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-diag">
        <h3>Ring a bell?</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Prospects go quiet right after a good sales call</li>
          <li>Your only "proof" is a logo wall</li>
          <li>You've got a customer who'd rave about you, but nobody's asked them yet</li>
          <li>Sales can't back up what they say</li>
          <li>You've been meaning to get a case study made for over a year</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="closing">If any of these sound familiar, you need proof to help you get deals over the line.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    padding: 120px 0;
    background: var(--yellow);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }
  .two-col {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .col-prose :global(.sec-head) {
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .col-prose :global(.sec-head h2) {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px);
  }
  .prose-body {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
  .prose-body p {
    font-size: 21px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .prose-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .prose-body p :global(em) {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  h3 {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 32px;
  }
  li {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink);
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  li::before {
    content: '—';
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .closing {
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin: 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .two-col {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }
</style>
